---
// POST /cases/{case_id}/report -> 202 (demo/p08_jobs_app.py). The 2 s job is from the post text.
---
<figure class="bep8a">
  <div class="bep8a-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 270" role="img" aria-label="Two lanes. The web process receives the POST, writes one job to Redis and returns 202 right away. Later, a separate worker takes the job and spends about 2 seconds building the report and sending the email.">
    <text x="40" y="78" class="h">web process</text>
    <text x="40" y="208" class="h">worker</text>

    <rect x="190" y="52" width="130" height="40" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="255" y="77" text-anchor="middle" class="code">POST /report</text>
    <line x1="320" y1="72" x2="364" y2="72" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="364,67 374,72 364,77" class="ah" />
    <rect x="374" y="52" width="130" height="40" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="439" y="77" text-anchor="middle" class="code">enqueue</text>
    <line x1="504" y1="72" x2="548" y2="72" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="548,67 558,72 548,77" class="ah" />
    <rect x="558" y="52" width="130" height="40" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="623" y="77" text-anchor="middle" class="code">202 Accepted</text>
    <text x="623" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>client is free, request over</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client được giải phóng, request xong</tspan></text>

    <line x1="439" y1="92" x2="439" y2="170" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="434,170 439,180 444,170" class="ah" />
    <text x="455" y="138" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>job waits in Redis</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>job nằm chờ trong Redis</tspan></text>

    <rect x="374" y="182" width="400" height="44" rx="8" class="box" />
    <text x="574" y="209" text-anchor="middle" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>build the report, send the email (about 2 s)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dựng report, gửi email (khoảng 2 s)</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The slow part moves to another process. The request only pays for one Redis write.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Phần chậm chuyển sang process khác. Request chỉ tốn một lần ghi Redis.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep8a { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep8a-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep8a svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 760px; height: auto; }
  .bep8a text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep8a .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14px; }
  .bep8a .h.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8a .s { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep8a .code { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text); }
  .bep8a .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep8a .bad { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep8a .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep8a .ln.red { stroke: var(--red); }
  .bep8a .ah { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep8a .ah.red { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep8a figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
